sub ls | Lists all the files that will be published/packaged
sub package alias=pack | Packages an extension
sub publish | Publishes an extension
sub unpublish | Removes an extension from the marketplace. Example extension
sub generate-manifest | Generates the extension manifest from the provided VSIX pack
sub verify-signature | Verifies the provided signature file against the provided VS
sub ls-publishers | Lists all known publishers
sub delete-publisher | Deletes a publisher from marketplace
sub login | Adds a publisher to the list of known publishers
sub logout | Removes a publisher from the list of known publishers
sub verify-pat | Verifies if the Personal Access Token or Azure identity has
sub show | Shows an extension's metadata
sub search | Searches extension gallery
sub help | display help for command
flag -V --version | output the version number
flag -h --help | display help for command
